*.img
# claude: anchored to their real build locations, and no longer bare
# words - a bare "kernel"/"mkfs" pattern also matches a DIRECTORY of
# that name, which the kernel/ and tools/ layout needs to exist. Same
# shape as forks/riscv64/.gitignore's own "/kernel/kernel", "/mkfs/mkfs".
/initcode
/initcode.out
/kernel/kernel
/tools/mkfs
